      "en": "A two-way sync can create a loop: A updates B → B sends a webhook → updates A → … Mark changes made by the automation (a field `updated_by = \"n8n\"` or a dedicated API user) and ignore them in the other direction, and compare values: if nothing really changed, do not update."
